  "releaseNotes": "0.6.9 keeps HDR gain maps through Resize, Thumbnail, Crop, AutoOrient, quarter-turn rotations and flips, and writes JPEG files with the ISO 21496-1 gain map (JpegEncoderOptions.GainMap, as libultrahdr). Adds ImageInfo.ContainerItemCount for container format plugins and -hdr keep in the CLI sample. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp/blob/v0.6.9/docs/releases/release-0.6.9.md",
